(text "CANDIDATE CONNECTION CONTRACT" (at 15.24 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f6dca051-9c67-5a2e-b803-41df8c532758"))
(text "J1/J2: male pins on underside; numbering describes top-view socket rows. Confirm orientation mechanically.\nVM contact physically omitted: J2 begins at host GND below VM. Board uses only 5 V from VCC_IO.\nU1: inverting open-drain outputs. Input HIGH sinks the corresponding MINUS terminal; LOW releases it.\n5 V input profile only: U1 VIH >= 0.7 x VCC. This candidate does not support unbuffered 3.3 V sources.\nDo not apply 24 V to J3. Verify EN disable polarity, startup, loaded edge timing and host 5 V rail before release.\nNo isolation or hardware safety function. Alarm wiring remains separate. ERC is not physical validation." (at 15.24 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a0e205eb-dd97-5dd0-990b-a6015942e9f8"))
(embedded_fonts no))
